  "details": "A VRChat wrapped like Spotify and Discord do.\n\nA few examples of what would be cool to see: \n\n• Distance moved/walked\n\n• Friends you spent the most time with\n\n• Group you spent the most time in the instances of\n\n• World you visited the most (maybe top 5 since home world is probably gonna be number one)\n\n• Avatar you wore the longest/most number of times\n\n• Longest time you stayed in a single VRChat session\n\n• How many gifts given \n\n|---> Maybe a rank system like Spotify does for your top artist. \n\n|---> Think something like \"You gave 1000 VRC+ gifts, that puts you in the top 0.01% of all gifters, how generous!\"\n\n• How many times you opened the personal mirror/How long you had it open for (leaderboard!)\n\nThe list goes on and on and on! \n\nAn OPT IN (or clear details in privacy policy outlining how collected data is used) would be amazing, since collecting this type of biometric data can be problematic. Perhaps it is stored locally like avatar hides and such? \n\nThe nuance can be figured out, just seems like a fun idea!",
